  "A RISK WITHOUT A COUNTERMEASURE IS A BLOCKER.\nthat is the DEFAULT \u2014 so silence stops the work\ninstead of passing it, which is the whole point.\n\na blocker clears ONE way: an explicit act of\nacceptance. who, when, on what basis. an\nACCEPTED UNKNOWN is a blocker accepted without\neven knowing its size \u2014 allowed, never by default.",
